  "description": "SEO Health for Umbraco: a Content-section dashboard that scans every published page in every language from the server, checks titles, meta descriptions, headings, canonical and hreflang tags, indexability, robots.txt, sitemaps, internal links and more against current best practice, scores the site over time, and lists prioritised issues with why they matter, how to fix them and a link to the page in Umbraco. Scans run nightly or on demand.",
